         <td>Trademark. &amp;trade; only recently supported. Use &lt;sup&gt;TM&lt;/sup&gt;
         for safety.  &amp;#153; only works in Latin-1. See this <a href="jglosst.html#TRADEMARK">full
         discussion</a> of the problems.  See &reg; &amp;reg;</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
